menu "Sprout feature modules"

config FEATURE_HABIT_REMINDER
    bool "Enable habit reminder cache"
    default y
    help
        Caches a bounded set of family habit reminders (local time of day,
        weekday set, enable flag and an optional prompt) persisted across
        restarts so the device can nudge a child offline and stay consistent
        with the parent app's companionship reminders.

endmenu
